<<^ code=`&#x0002;`>>

```toml meta
cacheable = true
l-space   = "stable"
role      = "rest the offer the next vessel carries: one vouch per lent face"
tags      = ["lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/affordance", "lar:///face.rite.offers", "candidate"]
title     = "lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/face.rite.offers"
type      = "text/memetic-wikitext+tiddlywiki"
uri-path  = "ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/face.rite.offers"
```

<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! face.rite.offers ~ offer ~ rite-offer in the standing vessel

`lares rite offer --branch <name> --head <commit> --image <digest>` runs `rite-offer` in the standing vessel between the build and the lowering: it gathers every lent face's line, signs one vouch per face over the image the host built, and rests the offer the next vessel carries to the pūlama. A keeper move rides as `--keeper-to <64 hex> --keeper-next sha256:<64 hex>`, both or neither. `--base` names the resting offer's hash this line read (`rite receipts --rite kukulu` answers it as `offerBase`); an overwrite without it refuses `conflict`.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ offer

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`offer` params=`branch/main head/<commit> image/<digest> ~ rest the offer over the built image`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ branch · head · image · keeper-to · keeper-next · base · face

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`branch` params=`takes/name needs/required ~ the lei's line`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`head` params=`takes/commit needs/required ~ the head the image built from`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`image` params=`takes/digest needs/required ~ the image the host built`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`keeper-to` params=`takes/hex needs/all-of:keeper-to,keeper-next ~ the successor keeper's key, 64 hex`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`keeper-next` params=`takes/digest needs/all-of:keeper-to,keeper-next ~ the committed closure, sha256:<64 hex>`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`base` params=`takes/hash ~ the resting offer's hash this line read`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`face` params=`takes/index ~ one face, a whole persona index from 0`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ seat

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`seat` params=`who/seat-or-hand key/face-vouch ~ signs one vouch per lent face over the image`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ usage · rite-offer-malformed · conflict

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`cure/[[face.rite.offers branch/main head/<commit> image/<digest>]] ~ the branch, head or image missing, or a half keeper move`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`rite-offer-malformed` params=`~ the offer reads malformed`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`conflict` params=`cure/[[face.rite.reads rite/kukulu]] ~ the resting offer moved past the base, or no base named over one`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ offered

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`offered` params=`exit/0 ~ the offer rests; the answer prints as JSON`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins`>>

!! skins ~ cli

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins/cli`>>

!!! lares rite offer

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`skin` name=`cli` params=`handler/host spells/[[lares rite offer]] ~ the terminal`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

